        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/thefacility/_scene_polarbear_005.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 28b45a5f-1547-44cd-979c-d332cb711832).Image",
        "Description": "Inside the ICA training facility, a cargo ship called the *Svanhild* secretly housed a global weapons smuggling ring. Crates labeled “farm equipment” hid rifles and explosives beneath the mock training decks. When a recruit stumbled onto the operation, alarms blared and chaos erupted. Then came the silent assassin: Agent 47. One by one, smugglers fell in the dark corridors until 47 uncovered a stolen ICA file capable of exposing the entire agency.",
